{"id":"f6otgsaoj2hsym70xdcl6u137","title":"唐本忠院士团队开发AIE-MXene水凝胶实现脉络膜黑色素瘤双模态协同治疗","originalTitle":"唐本忠院士等：AIE-MXene 水凝胶助力脉络膜黑色素瘤治疗","summary":"唐本忠院士团队在《Nano-Micro Letters》发表新型AIE-MXene纳米平台，通过近红外光热与光动力协同治疗，实现脉络膜黑色素瘤的精准诊疗。该平台利用72小时控释水凝胶实现“一次注射、多次治疗”，并验证了溶酶体-线粒体双细胞器递送机制。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3411509&do=blog&id=1560126"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-07T03:54:04.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T08:13:34.819Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-07T08:13:34.819Z","category":"clinical","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":73,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"c7ac922f-5049-4a84-bbe1-997a1f69f222","title":"唐本忠团队开发AIE-MXene水凝胶协同治疗脉络膜黑色素瘤"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"c7ac922f-5049-4a84-bbe1-997a1f69f222","title":"唐本忠团队开发AIE-MXene水凝胶协同治疗脉络膜黑色素瘤"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fox4tbO1oVlY","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}